🔹 Execution Order
Class load hone par

   1. Static variables initialize hote hain

   2. Static blocks execute hote hain (sirf ek baar, jab class load hoti hai)

Object create hone par

   1. Instance variables initialize hote hain (agar declaration ke time value di gayi ho to wo set hoti hai)

   2. Instance initializer blocks execute hote hain (har object ke liye)

   3. Constructor run hota hai (final setup ke liye)

   class Demo {
       static {
           System.out.println("Static block");
       }

       {
           System.out.println("Instance initializer block");
       }

       Demo() {
           System.out.println("Constructor");
       }

       public static void main(String[] args) {
           new Demo();
           new Demo();
       }
   }
